# The pixel menu example with the keyboard's actions, a gamepad and the mouse (a finger taps as the mouse clicks;
# the example's test sends one).
# From the list, up wraps to the last example.
20 press up
30 press confirm
# The menu: the cursor on TALK.
90 capture pixel-1-menu.png
# The gamepad: down skips TRADE and lands on LEAVE; up comes back.
100 pad 1 add xbox
102 pad 1 DPadDown down
104 pad 1 DPadDown up
120 capture pixel-2-pad.png
130 pad 1 DPadUp down
132 pad 1 DPadUp up
# The gamepad's A (confirm) opens the dialogue, which reveals its text.
150 pad 1 A down
152 pad 1 A up
170 capture pixel-3-reveal.png
# The mouse: a click on the arrow shows the rest of the page.
180 click 275,167
200 capture pixel-4-page.png
# A second click turns the page.
210 click 275,167
230 capture pixel-5-next.png
# The keyboard closes the last page.
310 press confirm
330 capture pixel-6-closed.png
# The mouse over LEAVE moves the cursor there.
340 mouse 160,78
360 capture pixel-7-hover.png
370 quit
